    <preface>
      <p>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Amendment (Coronavirus Economic Response Package) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 63, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Act 1975</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedules	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Act 1975	3</p>
      <p>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Amendment (Coronavirus Economic Response Package) Act 2020</p>
      <p>No. 63, 2020</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Act 1975</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>[<i>Assented to 19 June 2020</i>]</p>
      <formula name="enacting">
        <p>The Parliament of Australia enacts:</p>
      </formula>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <heading>Short title</heading>
        <content>
          <p>		This Act is the <i>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Amendment</i><i> </i><i>(</i><i>Coronavirus Economic Response Package</i><i>) </i><i>Act 20</i><i>20</i>.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p>Each provision of this Act specified in column 1 of the table commences, or is taken to have commenced, in accordance with column 2 of the table. Any other statement in column 2 has effect according to its terms.</p>
          </content>
          <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
              <th>Commencement information</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Column 1</td>
              <td>Column 2</td>
              <td>Column 3</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Provisions</td>
              <td>Commencement</td>
              <td>Date/Details</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>1.  The whole of this Act</td>
              <td>The day after this Act receives the Royal Assent.</td>
              <td>20 June 2020</td>
            </tr>
          </table>
          <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-1" marker="1">
            <content>
              <p>Note:	This table relates only to the provisions of this Act as originally enacted. It will not be amended to deal with any later amendments of this Act.</p>
            </content>
          </authorialNote>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-2__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>Any information in column 3 of the table is not part of this Act. Information may be inserted in this column, or information in it may be edited, in any published version of this Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Schedules</heading>
        <content>
          <p>Legislation that is specified in a Schedule to this Act is amended or repealed as set out in the applicable items in the Schedule concerned, and any other item in a Schedule to this Act has effect according to its terms.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
    </body>
    <attachments>
      <attachment>
        <hcontainer name="schedule" eId="schedule-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <heading>Amendments</heading>
          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Great Barrier Reef Marine Park Act 1975</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>At the end of Division 2 of Part VA</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA">
                  <num>39FAA</num>
                  <heading>One-off waiver of environmental management charge payable by permission holder—coronavirus economic response</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>Object</p>
                  </content>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>The object of this section is to waive certain charge payable by holders of chargeable permissions to:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-1__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>assist holders of such permissions directly or indirectly affected by the coronavirus known as COVID-19; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-1__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>facilitate interstate and overseas trade by helping sustain the viability of Australian businesses engaged, or usually engaged, in such trade.</p>
                      </content>
                      <content>
                        <p>Scope</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>	(2)	This section applies in relation to an amount of charge that is or was payable (the <b><i>charge amount</i></b>) by the holder of a chargeable permission in relation to the period (the <b><i>relevant period</i></b>):</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-2__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>beginning on <date date="2020-01-01">1 January 2020</date>; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-2__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>ending on <date date="2020-03-31">31 March 2020</date>.</p>
                      </content>
                      <content>
                        <p>Waiver of charge etc.</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-3">
                    <num>3</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>On the commencement of this section, payment of the charge amount, and any late payment penalty that relates to the charge amount, is taken to be waived.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>Refund for charge already paid</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-4">
                    <num>4</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>If, before the commencement of this section:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-4__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>the holder of a chargeable permission paid a charge amount; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-4__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>the charge amount related to the relevant period;</p>
                      </content>
                      <content>
                        <p>the Commonwealth must refund to the holder an amount equal to the charge amount.</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-5">
                    <num>5</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>Amounts payable under subsection (4) are to be paid out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund, which is appropriated accordingly.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>Sunset of appropriation</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__sec-39FAA__subsec-6">
                    <num>6</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>The appropriation set out in subsection (5) ceases to have effect at the end of <date date="2020-12-31">31 December 2020</date>.</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                </section>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>At the end of Division 2A of Part VA</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <section eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG">
                  <num>39FG</num>
                  <heading>One-off grant to holders of chargeable permissions—coronavirus economic response</heading>
                  <content>
                    <p>Object</p>
                  </content>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>The object of this section is to provide a one-off grant to holders of chargeable permissions to:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-1__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>assist holders of such permissions directly or indirectly affected by the coronavirus known as COVID-19; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-1__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>facilitate interstate and overseas trade by helping sustain the viability of Australian businesses engaged, or usually engaged, in such trade.</p>
                      </content>
                      <content>
                        <p>Scope</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-2">
                    <num>2</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>This section applies if a collected amount relates to a service provided by the holder of a chargeable permission in the period:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-2__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>beginning on <date date="2020-01-01">1 January 2020</date>; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-2__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>ending on <date date="2020-03-31">31 March 2020</date>.</p>
                      </content>
                      <content>
                        <p>One-off grant</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-3">
                    <num>3</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>On the commencement of this section:</p>
                    </content>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-3__para-a">
                      <num>a</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>a grant is payable to the holder of the chargeable permission equal to the amount of the collected amount; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-3__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>sections 39FB and 39G are taken not to apply, and to never have applied, in relation to the collected amount.</p>
                      </content>
                      <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                        <content>
                          <p>Note:	Section 39FB requires permission holders to pay collected amounts to <role refersTo="#authority">the Authority</role> on time and <ref href="#sec-39G">section 39G</ref> deals with late payment penalties.</p>
                        </content>
                      </authorialNote>
                      <content>
                        <p>Set-off</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-4">
                    <num>4</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>The Commonwealth must set off an amount payable to it under <ref href="#sec-39F">section 39F</ref>D against a payment the Commonwealth must make under paragraph (3)(a).</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-5">
                    <num>5</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>Amounts payable under paragraph (3)(a) are to be paid out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund, which is appropriated accordingly.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>Sunset of appropriation</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2__qstr-1__sec-39FG__subsec-6">
                    <num>6</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>The appropriation set out in subsection (5) ceases to have effect at the end of <date date="2020-12-31">31 December 2020</date>.</p>
                    </content>
                    <content>
                      <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                      <p><i>House of Representatives on 14 May 2020</i></p>
                      <p><i>Senate on 16 June 2020</i>]</p>
                      <p>(59/20)</p>
                    </content>
                  </subsection>
                </section>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
          </hcontainer>
        </hcontainer>
      </attachment>
    </attachments>
